Package: cinminai-firefox
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Cin-MinAI <https://github.com/Cin-MinAI/Cin-MinAI>
Section: web
Priority: optional
Depends: firefox, cinminai-daemon (>= @RELEASE@)
Description: Cin-MinAI in Firefox (summarize the YouTube video you have open)
 Installs the Cin-MinAI Firefox extension, signed by Mozilla, through Firefox's
 policy, so it is there without any step. When you ask the assistant about
 "this video", the extension reads the YouTube video open in the front tab: its
 transcript (as the page shows it) and YouTube's preview pictures. It can read
 youtube.com only, only when asked, and sends nothing anywhere: the assistant
 on this computer writes the summary.
